abstract: >-
  An educational, full-stack analytics project on global mental-health
  indicators (WHO 2021, IHME GBD 2023, World Bank). It provides reproducible
  pipelines, leakage-free machine learning with SHAP and conformal intervals,
  data-mining (UMAP, similarity networks, subgroup discovery, association rules),
  deep-learning forecasting, a FastAPI prediction service, and a Next.js website.
  Not a clinical tool.
